*.sw[po]

# agent-smith writes PLAN.md at the repo root as a living plan for the current
# piece of work, and removes it after the merge. It is never committed.
PLAN.md

# `make eval` writes aggregate-result.json and an HTML report per run into the
# plugin it evaluated. They are run artefacts of a paid, machine-local check,
# not repo contents.
plugins/*/evals/results/
